ORDER BY product_id, sale_date;", "subject": "Database", "category": "SQL Generation"}
{"question": "Write a SQL query to find the department with the highest average employee salary. Tables: employees (id, name, salary, department_id), departments (id, name).", "answer": "SELECT d.name as department_name, AVG(e.salary) as avg_salary
