WHERE o.order_date >= DATE_SUB(CURDATE(), INTERVAL 6 MONTH)
GROUP BY c.customer_id, c.name
HAVING COUNT(o.order_id) > 5;", "subject": "Database", "category": "SQL Generation"}
{"question": "Create a SQL query to retrieve the top 3 products with the highest average rating from the reviews table. Tables: products (product_id, product_name), reviews (review_id, product_id, rating).", "answer": "SELECT p.product_id, p.product_name, AVG(r.rating) AS avg_rating
