{"question": "Create a SQL query to calculate the monthly revenue for each product category for the year 2022. Tables: orders (order_id, order_date), order_items (order_id, product_id, price), products (product_id, category_id), categories (category_id, category_name).", "answer": "SELECT c.category_name, DATE_FORMAT(o.order_date, '%Y-%m') AS month, SUM(oi.price) AS monthly_revenue
