{"question": "Create a SQL query to calculate the monthly average order value for each product category. Tables: 'orders' (id, product_id, value, order_date), 'products' (id, category).", "answer": "SELECT p.category, DATE_TRUNC('month', o.order_date) as month, AVG(o.value) as avg_value FROM orders o JOIN products p ON o.product_id = p.id GROUP BY p.category, DATE_TRUNC('month', o.order_date);", "subject": "Database", "category": "SQL Generation"}
